  | ok truncf
  | ok j0
  | ok j1
  | ok jn
  | ok y0
  | ok y1
  | ok yn
  | ok drem
  | ok dremf
  | ok finite
  | ok finitef
  | ok scalb
  | ok scalbf
  | ok significand
  | ok significandf
  | ok lgamma_r
  | ok lgammaf_r
  | ok j0f
  | ok j1f
  | ok jnf
  | ok y0f
  | ok y1f
  | ok ynf
